OL,3,GNEWSAMel Giedroyc reunited with jacket 
OL,4,Afrom uni days                          
OL,6,FNearly 40 years after it disappeared,  
OL,7,Fcomedian and presenter Mel Giedroyc has
OL,8,Fbeen reunited with a leather jacket she
OL,9,Fwore "every single day at university"  
OL,10,Fafter it appeared at a charity shop.   
OL,12,FZoey Kennedy, manager at Oxfam in      
OL,13,FStroud, said she was straightening out 
OL,14,Fthe tartan lining of the jacket when   
OL,15,Fshe became "very excited".             
OL,17,F"On the name tag was Melanie Giedroyc  
OL,18,Fand I thought, could that be?" Kennedy 
OL,19,Fsaid.                                  
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
