OL,3,GNEWSAMel Giedroyc reunited with jacket 
OL,4,Afrom uni days                          
OL,6,FAfter making a trip to Gloucestershire 
OL,7,Fto be reunited with the jacket, the    
OL,8,Fformer Great British Bake Off star     
OL,9,Fsaid: "I wore this jacket every single 
OL,10,Fday at university; I thought I was a   
OL,11,Flittle bit cool, a little bit rock and 
OL,12,Froll. Then it disappeared out of my    
OL,13,Flife; I can't remember how."           
